"""Auto-generated tests for ``ai_billing_audit.clinical_metrics``.

Generated by test-generator subagent. Focus: branches-and-edges of the
public helper surface (every name in ``clinical_metrics.__all__``).
The FastAPI HTTP layer is intentionally NOT re-tested here — the
existing ``test_clinical_metrics.py`` and ``test_clinical_metrics_surfaces.py``
files already cover the mounted routes end-to-end.

What's pinned
-------------
* Every public dataclass round-trips through ``to_dict``.
* Every helper's happy path persists → reload returns the same row.
* Validation raises ``ValueError`` with a useful message on bad input.
* Cross-clinic / cross-doctor filtering isolates one tenant from another.
* Empty-log / empty-input edge cases return a structured response
  rather than crashing.
* ``compute_doctor_effectiveness`` and ``run_feedback_loop_week`` both
  fall back to empty results when the underlying ``FeedbackStore``
  raises (defensive exception guard).
"""

